    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can provide personalized explanations, adapting to how a student thinks. They can offer step-by-step solutions and clarify misunderstandings. They support multiple learning styles. They can also generate practice problems and offer instant feedback. This makes learning more interactive and accessible, especially for students who struggle with traditional teaching methods."
